  "identity": "Broad floating relic king, skeletal ivory face behind a gold-rimmed black visor, tall cracked gold crown, heavy dark steel and old bronze chest armor, enormous faded purple royal mantle with frayed ivory ermine dots. A round reliquary casket replaces its belly; short floating armored gauntlet hands, no feet. Pear-shaped regal mass, outraged tired posture.",
